 "description": "Any wallet's pump.fun trading record: realized PnL, win rate, hold time, frequency (bot or human), tokens it launched. Analyses up to the last 20,000 curve trades of the wallet. Use it to judge whether a wallet is smart money, a sniper bot, a serial dumper or a dev. When to use: For a trader's pump.fun performance. For a quick deal/no-deal verdict on any wallet use counterparty_check (on the MAD Synapse \u00b7 Wallets & Risk server, https://agent.maddegen.art/hub/mcp/risk); to test whether copying it pays use copy_backtest. Price: $0.01 per call (10 free/day; after that a payment-required result lists x402 options). Errors: returns isError with a message for invalid input or an upstream failure (not charged).",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "limit": {
    "default": 20000,
    "description": "How many of the wallet's most recent recorded trades to analyse. Range 100-20000. Default 20000.",
